### Create Vehicle
# @name createVehicle
POST http://localhost:5000/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "branchId": "{{branchId}}",
  "vin": "1HGBH41JXMN109186",
  "plateNumber": "ABC-1234",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "Camry",
  "year": 2024,
  "fuelType": "Gasoline",
  "transmission": "Automatic",
  "dailyRate": 45.00,
  "weeklyRate": 280.00,
  "monthlyRate": 1000.00,
  "currentOdometer": 5000,
  "currentFuel": 100,
  "purchaseCost": 28000.00
}

@vehicleId = {{createVehicle.response.body.vehicle.id}}

### Get All Vehicles
