PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "dailyRate": 50.00,
  "weeklyRate": 300.00,
  "currentOdometer": 5500,
  "currentFuel": 75
}

### Update Vehicle Status
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "status": "MAINTENANCE"
}

