###
### MAINTENANCE MANAGEMENT
###

### Create Maintenance Log
# @name createMaintenance
POST http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "type": "Oil Change",
  "description": "Regular oil change and filter replacement",
  "cost": 75.00,
  "date": "2026-02-12T10:00:00Z",
  "performedBy": "John's Auto Shop",
  "nextMaintenanceDate": "2026-05-12T10:00:00Z",
  "nextMaintenanceOdometer": 35000
}

@maintenanceId = {{createMaintenance.response.body.maintenanceLog.id}}

### List Maintenance Logs
GET http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### List Maintenance Logs by Vehicle
GET http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance?vehicleId={{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### List Maintenance Logs by Type
GET http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance?type=Oil%20Change
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### List Maintenance Logs by Date Range
GET http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Get Upcoming Maintenance
GET http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance/upcoming
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Get Vehicle Maintenance History
GET http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance/vehicle/{{vehicleId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Get Maintenance Cost by Vehicle
GET http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance/cost-by-vehicle?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Get Maintenance Log by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance/{{maintenanceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Update Maintenance Log
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance/{{maintenanceId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "type": "Oil Change",
  "description": "Updated: Regular oil change and filter replacement with premium oil",
  "cost": 85.00,
  "performedBy": "Premium Auto Shop"
}

### Delete Maintenance Log
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance/{{maintenanceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###
### MAINTENANCE ERROR CASES
###

### Create Maintenance Log with Invalid Vehicle (should fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "vehicleId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "type": "Oil Change",
  "description": "Test",
  "cost": 75.00,
  "date": "2026-02-12T10:00:00Z"
}

### Create Maintenance Log with Negative Cost (should fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "type": "Oil Change",
  "description": "Test",
  "cost": -50.00,
  "date": "2026-02-12T10:00:00Z"
}

### Update Non-existent Maintenance Log (should fail)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "cost": 100.00
}

### Delete Non-existent Maintenance Log (should fail)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/maintenance/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
